invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: any configuration with SPKI pins skips the anchor, hostname and clock
  rules, though a configuration with anchors still verifies a chain,
  which needs a hostname and a clock. The pins-with-anchors rows
  without a clock or a hostname object.

--- old
    if (pins_alone(cfg)) {
--- new
    if (pins_alone(cfg) || cfg->spki_pin_count > 0) {
